{"title":"Sand Devil","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 37 Dust Devil that attacks with corrode (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"tag-chip weak\">shock</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">slash</span> &nbsp; <i>Resists</i> <span class=\"tag-chip resist\">burn</span><span class=\"tag-chip resist\">crush</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 30% damage and a resistance takes 30% off (the game's own rule).</p>\n      <p class=\"s good\">⭐ Seen as an elite 20 times (2.0% of sightings). Elites have 3× HP, hit 1.4× harder, give 3× XP and 2.5× loot.</p>\n      <p class=\"s\">Special: mireChance: .25</p>\n      <p class=\"s\"><b>Reagent:</b> <a href=\"#/item/sirocco-core\">Sirocco Core</a> <span class=\"muted\">(infuses an enchant)</span>. About 1 kill in 500, 1 in 50 from an elite. <a href=\"#/guide/reforging\">Enchanter’s Table</a></p>\n      <h2>Levels</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Level\"><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/sand-devil\">All levels</a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/sand-devil?lv=36\">Lv 36 <span>15</span></a><a class=\"q-chip on\" href=\"#/monster/sand-devil?lv=37\">Lv 37 <span>1,682</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/sand-devil?lv=38\">Lv 38 <span>1,633</span></a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">The same monster spawns at different levels, and its hitpoints, damage and XP follow its level (the game’s own formula). In the game a monster more than 5 levels above you shows its level as “???”.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>HP</th><th>Damage</th><th>XP</th><th>Elite (HP · dmg · XP)</th><th>Seen</th><th>Mostly</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/sand-devil?lv=36\" title=\"Pick level 36\"><td><b>36</b></td><td>160</td><td>24.3</td><td>1,800</td><td class=\"muted\">480 · 34 · 5,400</td><td>15</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Old%20Thak%20Muster%20Ground\">Old Thak Muster Ground</a></td></tr><tr class=\"q-row-on\" data-href=\"#/monster/sand-devil\" title=\"Show all levels\"><td><b>37</b> <span class=\"muted\">(base)</span></td><td>168</td><td>24.9</td><td>1,850</td><td class=\"muted\">504 · 34.9 · 5,550</td><td>1,682</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Storm-Buried%20Caravan\">Storm-Buried Caravan</a></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/sand-devil?lv=38\" title=\"Pick level 38\"><td><b>38</b></td><td>176</td><td>25.4</td><td>1,900</td><td class=\"muted\">528 · 35.6 · 5,700</td><td>1,633</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Storm-Buried%20Caravan\">Storm-Buried Caravan</a></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"monster\" data-map-id=\"sand-devil\" data-map-level=\"37\">Show level 37 on the map</button>\n      \n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div class=\"muted\">No kills of this monster reported yet; 283 looted corpses recorded.</div><div style=\"margin-top:8px\"><b>Normal loot</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"scoured-glass\" title=\"Scoured Glass - in 198 of 283 looted corpses, 192 recorded drops, 407 total, 1–3 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/e3e1e7ee6d4d7434412d.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Scoured Glass</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1.4<br>×1–3</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"dust-mote\" title=\"Dust Mote - in 192 of 283 looted corpses, 184 recorded drops, 485 total, 1–10 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/1c70ff443aaceb81445a.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Dust Mote</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1.5<br>×1–10</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"mana-potion-large\" title=\"Mana Potion Large - in 13 of 283 looted corps